      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAPTAINS KNOCK (11) joined the Jason Grimson stable, and guess what, he won immediately by a wide margin in a 6-horse field at Albion Park 2 weeks ago. He will be even hard to beat in this. On top. DESSIE GEE (10) has been in excellent form with 2 wins and 2 placings from his past 5 starts, including a determined 1.1-metre victory over this track and trip last time out. The wide draw is the obvious concern, but he won't find this any harder and can win again. RIPP (7) tried hard when running on too late in Listed company here 2 weeks ago, and if he can settle closer early on, then he can figure in the top 3. Stick with him. UBETCHA TIGERPIE (8) finished a well beaten sixth in the Inter Dom consolation at Albion park 4 weeks ago, and that form will hold up in this. Include in all top 4 combos. ALTA WILLIAM (6) was a close third here last start after winning at Bathurst before that. Don't totally rule him out.",
